{"id":191,"gn":"Pokémon Graine","ft":["Il tombe du ciel sans crier gare en matinée. On en croise énormément l’année suivant un été froid.","Il tombe du ciel soudainement. S’il est attaqué par un Piafabec, il secoue violemment ses feuilles.","Il vit en buvant la rosée sur les feuilles. On dit qu’il ne peut rien avaler d’autre.","Tournegrin essaie de bouger le moins possible. C’est parce qu’il veut conserver tous les nutriments qu’il stocke dans son corps pour son évolution. Il ne mange pas, ne subsistant que grâce à la rosée matinale."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":2,"25":3,"26":3},"gr":4,"cr":235,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Végétal"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"sv":[0,31],"b2w2":[0,20],"hgss":[0,103],"c":[0,102],"gs":[0,102]},"f":{"191":{"n":"Tournegrin","t":["grass"],"s":[30,30,30,30,30,30],"h":0.3,"w":1.8,"a":[[34,0],[94,0],[48,1]],"pa":[[3,[[34,0]]],[4,[[34,0],[94,0]]]],"av":["sv","b2w2","hgss","c","gs"],"hi":[[169,5,[12,13,14,15,16,17,18]]],"ls":[{"l":[[33,1],[74,1],[71,7],[72,10],[75,16],[388,19],[202,22],[283,25],[235,28],[76,31],[38,34],[241,36],[402,39]],"m":[36,38,76,113,156,164,174,182,202,203,214,227,240,241,263,270,283,311,331,345,402,412,414,437,447,580,851,885],"e":[73,174,227,234,275,580]},{"l":[[71,1],[74,1],[275,4],[320,7],[72,10],[73,13],[75,16],[388,19],[202,22],[283,25],[235,28],[363,31],[76,34],[38,37],[241,40],[402,43]],"m":[14,15,76,92,104,113,148,156,164,182,188,207,213,216,218,219,237,241,263,412,447,496],"e":[73,117,174,203,227,230,234,267,270,275,320,363],"t":[173,202,214,235,253,270,283,388,402,414,495]},{"l":[[71,1],[74,1],[72,5],[275,9],[320,13],[73,17],[283,21],[388,25],[75,29],[235,33],[241,37],[202,41],[402,45]],"m":[14,15,76,92,104,113,148,156,164,182,188,202,203,207,213,214,216,218,219,237,241,263,290,331,363,412,445,447],"e":[73,174,227,230,267,270,275,320],"t":[173,235,253,270,283,388,402,414]},{"l":[[71,1],[74,4],[72,10],[241,19],[235,31],[202,46]],"m":[15,76,92,104,148,156,173,174,182,188,202,203,207,213,214,216,218,230,237,241]}],